<title>USA: Brightpoint makes Australian acquisition.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint makes Australian acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Friday that its subsidiary, Brightpoint International Ltd, completed formation of Brightpoint Australia Pty Ltd by acquiring the operations of Hatadicorp Pty Ltd in Sydney.</p>
<p>The newly formed entity will be owned 80 percent by Brightpoint International and 20 percent by the founder and current shareholders of Hatadicorp. Brightpoint Australia will distribute a broad range of wireless communication products.</p>
<p>For the year ended June 1996, Hatadicorp had sales of about US$32.5 million.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
